# Manual Verification Smoke (§17-lite)

## Authenticated Frontend Smoke First

For any frontend/browser verification, especially dashboard, Team
Insights, manager Call Review, roster, approvals, or objections, start
with the maintained auth/dev-server harness instead of manually
rediscovering ports or login state:

```
npm run test:manager-frontend-smoke
```

It starts backend/frontend if needed, uses the CORS-safe frontend origin,
loads ignored local manager smoke credentials when available, runs the
authenticated manager smoke, captures screenshots, and stops only the
dev servers it started. If this script fails for reusable setup reasons,
fix the script rather than bypassing it.

These source, contract, and fixture-cleanup files are gated by
`backend/scripts/manualVerificationSmokeRegression.ts`. After editing
any of them, run the smoke before finishing the turn:

```
cd backend && npm run test:regression:manual-verification-smoke
```

Expected: `Manual Verification Smoke (§17-lite): passed=92 failed=0`.

If a check fails, fix at the root — keep the dispatch / contract /
clamp policy in `shared/` (or its backend pure helper). Do not
silence a failing assertion or weaken a check to make it green.

## What each file gates

- `shared/src/coaching/nextActionDispatch.ts` — `describeManagerIntent`
  / `describeRepIntent`; total over every `NextActionKind` and every
  rep sentinel href. A new kind on the server must add a branch here.
- `shared/src/coaching/nextAction.ts` — adding a new `NextActionKind`
  changes the exhaustiveness surface above.
- `shared/src/coaching/teamRosterView.ts` — SavedView serializer /
  deserializer for the `team_roster` scope. Round-trip must be an
  identity; unknown enum values must fall back per-field.
- `shared/src/coaching/activation.ts` — engagement vs coaching queue
  partition. Exactly `active` is coaching-eligible; the other five
  feed engagement.
- `shared/src/coaching/window.ts` — preset window math. `from < to`,
  `isInsideWindow` includes both boundaries.
- `shared/src/coaching/contracts.ts` — `SkillScoreDTO` 0..100 absolute
  scale. Scores and `benchmark.teamAvg` must clamp to `[0, 100]`.
- `backend/src/lib/coaching/annotationService.ts` —
  `normalizeAnnotationRange`. Negative start clamped, non-finite or
  collapsed range discarded, fractional ms rounded.
- `scripts/runEndToEndSurfaceSmoke.mjs` — must call the generated-fixture
  cleanup path by default, honor the explicit keep-fixture override, and fail
  a successful smoke when generated-fixture cleanup fails.
- `backend/scripts/e2eSurfaceSmokeSetup.ts` — must use stack-aware org
  provisioning helpers, seed only paid/CUSTOMER fixtures, and refuse accidental
  remote database seeding unless explicitly opted in for a disposable DB.
- `backend/scripts/e2eSurfaceSmokeCleanup.ts` — must target generated run/org
  fixture rows only.
- `backend/scripts/cleanupE2eSurfaceSmokeFixtures.ts` — must stay dry-run by
  default and remain scoped to generated surface-smoke fixture identifiers.
- `backend/package.json` — must keep the explicit
  `cleanup:e2e-surface-fixtures` command registered.
